# The owner's ruling of 2026-11-21 (docs/engine-design.md, "Taking back an illegal action"): a card a cost discards is
# chosen as the cost is paid and discarded only as the spell is committed, so a cast given up moves nothing out of the
# hand. Bitter Triumph's additional cost is a discard here (CR 601.2b, 118.8), and Bot2's Drought adds "Sacrifice a Swamp"
# for its {B} (CR 601.2f), chosen after the discard (CR 601.2h). Bot1 floats {B}{B}, casts Bitter Triumph at Bot2's
# Memnite and chooses an Island to discard; at the Swamp to sacrifice nothing is in the graveyard and all three Islands are
# in the hand, and the cast is given up (CR 733.1): Bitter Triumph is back in hand, the {B}{B} in the pool. Cast again, the Swamp
# is sacrificed and, as the cast is committed, the Island discarded - after the Swamp, the order the engine chose for
# steps whose order cannot matter. Memnite is destroyed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Swamp
Bitter Triumph
Island
Island
Plains
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Drought
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Drought.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {B}{B}
Bot1.Hand.Bitter Triumph.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Modes(Discard a card)
Bot1.Choose(Island#1)
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
? Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Plains
Bot1.Cancel
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Mana = {B}{B}
? Bot1.Hand = Bitter Triumph; Island; Island; Island; Plains
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Bitter Triumph.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Modes(Discard a card)
Bot1.Choose(Island#1)
Bot1.Choose(Swamp#2)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Island; Swamp
? Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Plains
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Plains
Bot1.Graveyard = Bitter Triumph; Island; Swamp
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite; Black Lotus
